        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solid State Drive, SSD, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solid State Drive, SSD, at plant
The dataset is built from a technical report about environmental impacts of ICT; UUID: 004e957b-5e8d-389a-901c-17b09952eef2
The dataset is based on an SSD with 800 GB storage capacity. It is assumed that the storage capacity per area or NANDproDIE is 49.8 GB/cm2. It is also assumed that there are 2 PCBS per unpopulated board each having an area of 54.2 cm2 / PCB. Weight is assumed to be 64 g/SSD.
Location: Data for SSD, applicable for average SSD storages.
Technology: Typical SSD with the defined storage data capacity
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_004e957b-5e8d-389a-901c-17b09952eef2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
